From a433e027c91258060c92edef4373f46533717faf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niels Peter Roest <nero@jobindex.dk>
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2026 16:05:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Replace re2go with stdlib regexp

Remove the internal/re2go package (generated DFA-based matchers) and replace
with standard regexp. This removes the re2go build dependency and ~5000 lines
of generated code. The regex variables are exported (Rx prefix) so consumers
can override them.
---
